Here is the dynamic, filterable dashboard interface to display and filter your eight project deliverables. 

This design uses a two-column layout (`columns` as the root component):
* **Left Column:** A control sidebar containing a `segmented_control` to filter by status ("All", "Active", "Pending", "Completed") along with summary `stat_card` KPIs.
* **Right Column:** The core `entity_list` displaying all eight deliverables, complete with their titles, statuses, details, custom icons, and metadata tags.

### 1. Create the UI Surface

First, we establish the surface container.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "deliverables-tracker-surface",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

### 2. Populate the Components

Next, we define the component layout tree. The root `columns` component appears first, establishing a hierarchical, top-down structure.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "deliverables-tracker-surface",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 2,
        "gap": "2rem",
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "filter-title",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Filter Deliverables"
              },
              {
                "id": "status-filter-control",
                "component": "segmented_control",
                "name": "status_filter",
                "options": "[{\"label\": \"All\", \"value\": \"all\"}, {\"label\": \"Active\", \"value\": \"active\"}, {\"label\": \"Pending\", \"value\": \"pending\"}, {\"label\": \"Completed\", \"value\": \"completed\"}]",
                "selected_value": "all"
              },
              {
                "id": "stat-total",
                "component": "stat_card",
                "value": "8",
                "label": "Total Tracked Items",
                "accent": "#3B82F6"
              },
              {
                "id": "stat-active",
                "component": "stat_card",
                "value": "3",
                "label": "Active Status",
                "accent": "#10B981"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "list-title",
